  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_028: 0.5362 accuracy) outperform RNA-only models with pca_n2000 (config_001: 0.4849). Testing config_004 (RNA-only, scvi_n200) isolates the RNA encoder's impact and compares it to the multimodal baseline. This clarifies whether the scvi_n200 encoder's benefits are inherent to the modality or synergistic with image data, addressing key uncertainty about encoder choices and multimodal value."
}

